              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने खिळा ठोकला, tyāne khiḷā ṭhoklā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The place takes -त: भिंतीत खिळा ठोकणे (ṭhokṇe), to drive a nail into a wall."
            }
          ]
        },
